msgid ""
"All speakers appear in these standings, no matter how many debates they've "
"missed."
msgstr ""

#: standings/templates/speaker_standings.html:48
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Enforcing the limit on the number of missed debates requires the \"number of "
"speeches given\" metric to be included in the speaker standings "
"calculations, so it's been automatically added. To remove this warning "
"message, add <strong>Number of speeches given</strong> to the "
"<strong>Speaker standings extra metrics</strong> in the <a "
"href=\"%(standings_config_url)s\" class=\"alert-link\">Standings section of "
"this tournament's configuration</a>."
msgstr ""

